  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced.\n• Cut carrot and zucchini into bite-sized chunks.\n• Place veggies on a lined oven tray. Drizzle with olive oil, season with saltand toss to coat.\n• Roast until tender, 20-25 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/681d80ed35963fcd98f40af6/step-f1076e00.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• When veggies have 10 minutes remaining, in a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over high heat.\n• Cook veggie mince, breaking up with a spoon, until just browned, 4-5 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/681d80ed35963fcd98f40af6/step-87374a10.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Reduce pan to medium heat, then add tomato paste and mild sambal seasoning and cook until fragrant, 1 minute.\n• Stir in coconut milk, stock and the water and simmer until slightly thickened, 2-3 minutes.\n• Remove pan from heat, then add roasted veggies and baby spinach leaves, stirring to coat. Season with salt and pepper to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/681d80ed35963fcd98f40af6/step-02ca3c20.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• While curry is simmering, microwave basmati rice until steaming, 2-3 minutes.\n• Divide instant rice and coconut plant-based mince curry between bowls.\n• Sprinkle over crushed peanuts to serve. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/681d80ed35963fcd98f40af6/step-06452b30.jpg"
    }
  ]
